
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5146
@agentId = agent-1
@callId = replace-with-call-id

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Get service availability
GET {{baseUrl}}/service
Accept: application/json

### Set service to automatic schedule
PUT {{baseUrl}}/service/Schedule
Accept: application/json

### Force service open
PUT {{baseUrl}}/service/Open
Accept: application/json

### Force service closed
PUT {{baseUrl}}/service/Closed
Accept: application/json

### Get call queue status
GET {{baseUrl}}/queue
Accept: application/json

### Get agents
GET {{baseUrl}}/agents
Accept: application/json

### Agent accepts waiting call
POST {{baseUrl}}/agents/{{agentId}}/accept/{{callId}}
Accept: application/json

### OpenAPI document (Development only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi/v1.json
Accept: application/json
